      "id": "regenerate-all-entries",
      "name": "RegenerateAllEntries",
      "category": "ListViewBase",
      "signature": "RegenerateAllEntries(Target)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "UListViewBase*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Full regeneration of all entries in the list. Note that the entry UWidget instances will not be destroyed, but they will be released and re-generated.\nIn other words, entry widgets will not receive Destruct/Construct events. They will receive OnEntryReleased and IUserObjectListEntry implementations will receive OnListItemObjectSet."
